---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import GalleryGrid from '../components/GalleryGrid.astro';
import Lightbox from '../components/Lightbox.astro';

const ocean = [
  { image_path: '/gallery/202512_landsend/DSC00369.webp', width: 1440, height: 2560, alt: '粉紫色天空下的大片海面与弧形浪线，沙滩上的两个人显得很小' },
];
const tunnel = [
  { image_path: '/gallery/202512_landsend/DSC00351.webp', width: 2560, height: 1440, alt: '幽暗洞口框住海面和礁石，一个人站在亮处成为剪影' },
];
const sunset = [
  { image_path: '/gallery/202512_landsend/DSC00359.webp', width: 2560, height: 1440, loading: 'eager' as const, alt: '落日把海面染成金色，浪花从深色礁石旁涌过' },
];
---

<BaseLayout title="Lands End - Q's Blog" description="2025.12 | San Francisco 的海岸，金色落日、洞口剪影与大片海面里的小人物。">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="gallery-header">
      <h1>Lands End</h1>
      <div class="gallery-description"><p><strong>2025.12 | San Francisco</strong></p></div>
    </header>
  </div>

  <section class="sunset" aria-label="海上落日">
    <GalleryGrid images={sunset} layout="single" />
  </section>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="gallery-description story-note">
      <p>傍晚的光从云隙间落下来，在海面上铺成一片金色。礁石仍是暗的，浪绕过它们，向岸上展开。海面上的光忽明忽暗，细纹一直铺向天边。</p>
      <p class="place-note"><a href="https://www.nps.gov/goga/planyourvisit/landsend.htm">Lands End</a> 位于旧金山西北角。海岸步道沿峭壁延伸，Sutro Baths 的遗址就在附近。</p>
    </div>

    <section class="tunnel" aria-label="洞口剪影">
      <GalleryGrid images={tunnel} layout="single" />
    </section>
    <div class="gallery-description scene-note">
      <p>洞内很暗，出口却是一片明亮。一个人的侧影立在海前，礁石、浪和远处的天空，都收进这道不规则的边框里。</p>
    </div>
    <section class="ocean" aria-label="海与人">
      <GalleryGrid images={ocean} layout="single" />
    </section>
    <div class="gallery-description scene-note closing-note">
      <p>天光淡成粉紫。湿润的沙滩留着一层薄水，映出天空，也映出两个人的影子。浪线一弯弯推近，天与海之间，只留下很小的身影。</p>
      <p class="place-note">2025.12，Lands End</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Lightbox />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .ocean { max-width: 580px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .story-note, .scene-note { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--color-text); }
  .story-note { padding: 1rem 0 3rem; }
  .scene-note { padding: 0.5rem 0 3rem; }
  .closing-note { padding-bottom: 4rem; }
  .place-note { font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .tunnel { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .sunset { width: 100%; max-width: 1600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1rem clamp(1rem, 4vw, 5rem) 2rem; }
  .sunset :global(.gallery-grid.layout-single) { max-width: none; }
  section :global(.gallery-item img) { height: auto; object-fit: contain; }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .story-note, .scene-note { padding-bottom: 2rem; }
    .closing-note { padding-bottom: 3rem; }
  }
</style>
